{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4a160ab6eb7208c4d53fae32593d3d7d9bff8d21dae4cf7de79ac4f3cd70b8dc", "ja": "（以前、海賊の船長を演じた事がきっかけになって、\n歩にクルーザーでの撮影の仕事がきた）", "zh": "（之前因为演过海盗船长，步接到了在游艇上拍摄的工作）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c67ec662098513f1274d6dd21d2d4b59589e8677214e02eb5b27037bbe8bd5e0", "ja": "ん～、やっぱ海っていいよね！　水平線を見てると、\nなんだかワクワクしてくるっていうか。", "zh": "嗯～，大海果然很棒呢！看着地平线，总觉得心里变得雀跃起来，怎么说呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e19660f0484c50e893af7664e8f2a056056fc1c3143949b230916cc847d28613", "ja": "前、船長をやった時も、\n船の冒険って楽しそうだなーって思ったんだよ。", "zh": "之前当船长的时候，我也觉得船上冒险什么的好像很有意思——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1003_p", "source_sha256": "21a6e5cccc9f5096fb5ab715ce37c0057a10fc331a9442b9d033876c20c4c241", "ja": "ロマンがあるよな。まあ現実だと、\n冒険なんてそうそうないとは思うけど。", "zh": "很浪漫啊。不过现实中，我觉得冒险这种事也不是随处都有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "18be3309cbb620169732b56770564856a3bc703bc8006ccdd3972bb0d8efd919", "ja": "物語みたいな冒険は無理かもだけど、\nクルーザーで世界一周！　とか？　楽しそうじゃん！", "zh": "像故事一样的冒险可能做不到，不过，乘坐游艇环游世界！之类的？感觉很有意思嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e8cc0f05324ceb9105632597633123e61eee633be84a9b6aaf7f5a1c156c92e2", "ja": "クルーザーって、やっぱり高いよね……。\nでも、トップアイドルになったら買えるかな？", "zh": "游艇果然很贵吧……  \n不过，等我成为顶级偶像后，应该就买得起了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a1ea25e2610a580cb70938d27fdbab07cd2b1456cf8675728e75f1a050b1287e", "ja": "はは、そうだな。きっと買えると思うぞ！\nそうしたら俺も乗せてくれ。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。我觉得成了顶级偶像的话，一定买得起！\n到时候也载我一起吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bac83081da4de57389281e2c4e61262f5e52bc135423f00b5ec07384e1b7073f", "ja": "いいね！　{$P$}を誘って、\nワールドワイドに大冒険！って……あっ。", "zh": "太好了！邀请{$P$}，来一场环游世界的大冒险！……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9a85a69eb4b1dcce9e9d996f6f48877eb33dec24e7ccbff04616d214b7475158", "ja": "うん？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4c83899e3db07a30d154f9d476bcfd1edd464e2d8e8ec8b8464359dbaee98599", "ja": "う、うぅ……なんか、この前の撮影のときのこと、\n思い出してきちゃってさ……マイガー！", "zh": "呜、呜……总觉得突然想起了\n上次拍摄时的事情……天哪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d5a741cec5dbd864513f4f528e672c23ce40b1c6be6f2f206f6625a202564cb2", "ja": "ほ、ほら、俳優さんが急病で、\n{$P$}が代役をしてくれたじゃん？", "zh": "那、那个，你看，演员突然生病了，{$P$}不是替他上场了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ab9d775334eed9b3600e6d7f0e34058ba0cf17d2886ba820659114909c86f977", "ja": "アタシ、{$P$}を船に誘うために、\n色々恥ずかしいセリフを言っちゃって……うぅっ！", "zh": "我、为了邀请{$P$}上船，说了好多羞人的台词……呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1012_p", "source_sha256": "dbc2f690015bf95d327233e9a238e68d2caef08f36eeb6f59d879a7c536392bb", "ja": "そういえば、そうだったな。\nまあでも、あれはああいう役だったわけだし……。", "zh": "这么说来，确实是那样啊。  \n不过，那毕竟就是那种角色嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "20060de78facbf531baa535f1cc03b6f7e210e375745ab97df6fcd4d40b5a31b", "ja": "そりゃそうだけどさ……。\n恥ずかしいもんは恥ずかしいんだよ～！", "zh": "话是这么说没错……  \n可害羞就是害羞嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1014_p", "source_sha256": "edc8e3c766b2d7ee1454953d663d4bffde16614653144dc517fafd415d2a80b2", "ja": "うーん……。\nなんかゴメンな、これから撮影だってのに。", "zh": "嗯……总觉得挺抱歉的，明明你接下来还要拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f3efc959c658874f30e1f5023ce99e32f3d86d7981ab3c77c5e0c5a3349a4133", "ja": "い、いや、{$P$}が謝ることないよ！\nアタシが勝手に恥ずかしくなってるだけだし……。", "zh": "不、不是，{$P$}没必要道歉！\n只是我自己莫名其妙觉得害羞而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8295f83bd53b12241c4e71a0833ffc5ca3a736666f19d7185135959b85d85c05", "ja": "そ、それに、あの時は急だったから！\n今日は大丈夫、心の準備はバッチリだよ！", "zh": "而、而且，那时候太突然了嘛！今天没问题，心理准备已经做好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5ae18ed8e74a0300d30318a93a78a05cbb1d9805c59d00008d1420b7db0aaf0e", "ja": "ちゃんと{$P$}を誘惑できるように\n頑張るからね！　ノープロブレム！", "zh": "我会努力做到能好好诱惑{$P$}的！没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6907e9fb397b1e581a300a02759e3aafccb9937cfe24b262cebc4229920695dc", "ja": "あ、うん……やる気はありがたいけど。\n今日は別に、海賊の役ってわけじゃないから……。", "zh": "啊，嗯……你的干劲我很感谢。\n不过今天又不是要演海盗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0233_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0233_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7c0e4650bb857c57253b5e0c715b4287bcaa0b52b8a0b5dab6a949b1ffca925c", "ja": "え？　あっ……そうだ、誘惑する必要ないじゃん！　\nううっ……今のナシね、{$P$}……。", "zh": "诶？啊……对了，根本没必要去诱惑嘛！\n呜呜……刚才那句不算，{$P$}……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
